Huh?

00:18:05.330 --> 00:18:08.290
Good evening, Sherlock Holmes- <i>san</i> .

00:18:08.290 --> 00:18:10.000
What are you doing here?

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:13.200
Saying hello to an old friend.

00:18:15.580 --> 00:18:20.000
That's why I didn't want to take this job.

00:18:20.000 --> 00:18:22.830
Oh, Watson- <i>san</i> . Good evening.

00:18:22.830 --> 00:18:27.040
Or should I say, "Johnwa Kobayashi- <i>san</i> "?

00:18:28.330 --> 00:18:31.410
Oh, you look so angry!

00:18:31.410 --> 00:18:36.790
Sorry. The real USB drive is already in Paris.

00:18:36.790 --> 00:18:38.290
Now then...

00:18:38.290 --> 00:18:40.160
I'll be going.

00:18:40.160 --> 00:18:43.200
If I ever come back
to this country, I'll drop by.

00:18:45.000 --> 00:18:46.500
<i>Au revoir.</i>

