00:19:19.910 --> 00:19:21.500
Have you seen Sherlock?

00:19:21.500 --> 00:19:23.500
He went that way.

00:19:23.500 --> 00:19:24.580
Thanks!

00:19:31.120 --> 00:19:32.830
Where's the drive?

00:19:34.830 --> 00:19:36.160
Give it to me.

00:19:38.250 --> 00:19:39.580
Get away from her!

00:20:06.750 --> 00:20:10.790
