all the work to make that dummy drive.

00:20:10.790 --> 00:20:16.700
A cautious woman like you would
never let it out of her sight.

00:20:16.700 --> 00:20:20.450
But you were nice enough
to tell me exactly where it was.

00:20:36.500 --> 00:20:38.040
Sherlock did that?

00:20:38.040 --> 00:20:41.450
Yeah. I've never seen him look so mad.

00:20:48.370 --> 00:20:51.200
Who's that?

00:20:51.200 --> 00:20:53.750
No idea. A client?

00:20:57.040 --> 00:20:59.080
Looks like it was a waste of time.

00:20:59.080 --> 00:20:59.290
No, I'll see if we can restore the data.

00:20:59.290 --> 00:21:02.410
"Rakugo Trading Card"

00:20:59.290 --> 00:21:02.410
No, I'll see if we can restore the data.

00:21:02.790 --> 00:21:06.700
We'll pay the 15,000,000 after
we've confirmed it's real.

00:21:06.700 --> 00:21:10.500
You're as impressive as ever though, Sherlock.

00:21:11.660 --> 00:21:12.000
"Lamphouse Koyoru"

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:16.000
"Lamphouse Koyoru"

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:16.000
I'll be going.

00:21:16.000 --> 00:21:18.160
Yeah. Thanks.

